# Frontend environment variables (Vite). Copy relevant lines into a .env file.
#
# VITE_API_BASE_URL — public origin of the 9XAIPal backend API.
#
#   Local dev:  leave this UNSET. Requests stay relative ('/api/v1') and Vite
#               proxies them to the backend on http://localhost:8000.
#
#   Hosted UI:  set it to a reachable backend origin so the deployed frontend
#               (e.g. on Vercel) talks to your backend instead of 404-ing
#               against the static host:
#                 VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend.example.com
#
# This is a BUILD-TIME value (baked into the client bundle by Vite), so you must
# redeploy after changing it. The backend must allow the frontend's origin via
# its CORS_ORIGINS setting.
